(PAGE 71: LIVESTOCK FARMING - DAIRY CATTLE & BUFFALO MANAGEMENT) '
(Core Practices for Profitable Dairy:) '
(1. Breeds & Genetics: High-yielding indigenous breeds \\(Gir, Sahiwal, Rathi\\) and buffal) '
(2. Balanced Nutrition & TMR: Feed Total Mixed Ration \\(TMR\\) comprising 60% green fodder) '
(3. Housing & Milking Hygiene: Free-stall loose housing with grooved non-slip concrete floo) '
(4. Health & Mastitis Prevention: Practice post-milking teat dipping in 0.5% povidone-iodin) '
ET
endstream
endobj
