endobj
147 0 obj
<< /Length 751 >>
stream
BT
/F1 12 Tf
50 780 Td
15 TL
(PAGE 72: LIVESTOCK FEED - FODDER PRODUCTION & SILAGE PRESERVATION) '
(Year-Round Green Fodder Security:) '
(1. High-Yielding Perennial Grasses: Super Napier \\(CO-4 / CO-5\\) yielding 150-200 tonnes) '
(2. Winter & Leguminous Fodder: Berseem \\(Trifolium alexandrinum\\) and Lucerne \\(Alfalfa) '
(3. Bunker & Pit Silage Making \\(Maize Fodder\\):) '
(- Harvest single-cross fodder maize at 50% milk-line \\(30-35% dry matter\\).) '
(- Chop to 1.5-2.0 cm, inoculate with Lactobacillus plantarum \\(1x10^6 CFU/g\\) or 1% jagg) '
(- Compact tightly in concrete bunker silos to expel oxygen; seal hermetically with 200-mic) '
(- Ferments in 45 days into golden-brown aromatic silage \\(pH 3.8-4.2, lactic acid >6%\\),) '
ET
endstream
endobj
