/F1 12 Tf
50 780 Td
15 TL
(PAGE 73: LIVESTOCK FARMING - SMALL RUMINANT MANAGEMENT \\(GOAT & SHEEP\\)) '
(Commercial Goat & Sheep Production:) '
(1. Prolific Breeds: Black Bengal \\(high twinning rate >80%\\), Jamnapari & Sirohi \\(dual) '
